§§ `Item 9 -- offences under any Act with a tax or duty`

-- "An offence under any Act of Parliament or law of the legislature of a province that provides for the
-- imposition of a tax or duty for which the maximum term of imprisonment is five years or more." Read as:
-- the offence is under an Act or law that provides for the imposition of a tax or duty, and the maximum term
-- of imprisonment for the offence is at least five years (fork F-sched-9-1 in NOTES.md: the text does not
-- say whether "for which" attaches to the tax or duty or to the offence).
-- src:3541 | 9 An offence under any Act of Parliament or law of the legislature of a province that provides for the imposition of a tax or duty for which the maximum term of imprisonment is five years or more.
@ref CBCA Schedule item 9 (src:3541)
GIVEN `the offence is under an Act of Parliament or a law of the legislature of a province` IS A BOOLEAN
      `that Act or law provides for the imposition of a tax or duty` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the maximum term of imprisonment for the offence in years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an offence is within item 9 of the Schedule` IF
        `the offence is under an Act of Parliament or a law of the legislature of a province`
    AND `that Act or law provides for the imposition of a tax or duty`
    AND `the maximum term of imprisonment for the offence in years` AT LEAST 5

§§ `Whether an offence is in the Schedule`

