-- src:3387 | (f) section 83.04 (using or possessing property for terrorist purposes);
-- src:3388 | (g) section 83.12 (freezing of property, disclosure or audit);
-- src:3389 | (h) subsection 83.18(1) (participation in activity of terrorist group);
