@ref CBCA Schedule (src:3381-3541)
GIVEN act IS A `Act the Schedule lists offences under`
      `the section of the Act the offence is under` IS A STRING
      `the subsection the offence is under, or empty` IS A STRING
      `the section contravened, or empty` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an offence is listed in items 1 to 8 of the Schedule` IF
    any (GIVEN row YIELD `a row of the Schedule matches the offence` row act `the section of the Act the offence is under` `the subsection the offence is under, or empty` `the section contravened, or empty`) `the offence provisions listed in items 1 to 8 of the Schedule`

