-- src:3516 | (a) subsections 5(1) and (2) (trafficking in substance and possession for purpose of trafficking);
-- src:3517 | (b) subsections 6(1) and (2) (importing and exporting and possession for the purpose of exporting);
-- src:3518 | (c) subsection 7(2) (production of substance).
-- src:3519 | 5 An offence under any of the following provisions of the Corruption of Foreign Public Officials Act:
