-- src:3521 | (b) subsection 4(1) (accounting);
-- src:3522 | (c) subsection 5(1) (offence committed outside Canada).
-- src:3523 | 6 An offence under any of the following provisions of the Canadian Environmental Protection Act, 1999:
-- src:3524 | (a) subsection 272(1); (contravention by persons of certain provisions);
-- src:3525 | (b) subsection 272.1(1); (contravention by persons of certain provisions);
-- src:3526 | (c) subsection 272.2 (1) (failure to comply with designated regulations);
-- src:3527 | (d) subsections 272.4(1), (2) and (3); (contravention by ships of certain provisions);
-- src:3528 | (e) subsections 272.5(1), (2) and (3); (contravention by ships of certain provisions);
-- src:3529 | (f) subsections 274(1) and (2) (damage to environment and risk of death or harm to persons and criminal negligence).
-- src:3530 | 7 An offence under any of the following provisions of the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act:
