-- src:3536 | (b) subsections 10(1) and (2) (selling and possession for purpose of selling);
-- src:3537 | (c) subsections 11(1) and (2) (importing and exporting and possession for purpose of exporting);
-- src:3538 | (d) subsections 12(1), (4), (5), (6) and (7) (production, cultivation, propagation and harvesting);
-- src:3539 | (e) subsection 13(1) (possession, etc., for use in production or distribution of illicit cannabis);
-- src:3540 | (f) subsection 14(1) (use of young person).
-- src:3541 | 9 An offence under any Act of Parliament or law of the legislature of a province that provides for the imposition of a tax or duty for which the maximum term of imprisonment is five years or more.
@ref CBCA Schedule (src:3381-3541)
GIVEN act IS A `Act the Schedule lists offences under`
      `the section of the Act the offence is under` IS A STRING
      `the subsection the offence is under, or empty` IS A STRING
      `the section contravened, or empty` IS A STRING
      `the offence is within item 9` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an offence is in the Schedule` IF
        `an offence is listed in items 1 to 8 of the Schedule` act `the section of the Act the offence is under` `the subsection the offence is under, or empty` `the section contravened, or empty`
    OR  `the offence is within item 9`
